    "updated_at": "2026-03-06T23:33:44Z",
    "body": "I may be missing something here, step 3.1.3.2 does give null registry element the document's effective global registry (in this case is `window.customElements`) so the inner element should get upgraded.\n\n> However, we don't want to always replace a null registry, and there's no \"keep null registries\" flag on element.\n\nThis will be fixed once we have customElementRegistry global attribute in place. See https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12000 for reference.",
