    "updated_at": "2026-03-09T14:32:29Z",
    "body": "[`.cloneNode()` IDL](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-node-clonenode) seems to not be providing `fallbackRegistry` in the [cloning a node](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-clone) steps, is this correct? Perhaps it should supply `fallbackRegistry`.",
